Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:09.72,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,I inversed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:13.66,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Every single spell you \Ncan use with that artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.58,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,You lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:49.91,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,A troublesome problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:26.50,Episode Title,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(653,521)\blur3.5\q2\an3\i0\b0\3c&H447135&\pos(342.667,306.833)}Episode 19
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:26.50,Episode Title,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(653,521)\blur3.5\q2\an3\pos(547.67,290.5)}{\fs26\3c&H7AAE67&} {\3c&H447135&\b0}Awakening
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:41.28,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Absolute Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.22,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.15,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,It was just as Desir said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:21.22,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:25.46,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,That monster takes no \Ndamage from average magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:28.64,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,I'll have to use a \Nslightly bigger spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.75,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Please step back, Priscilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:31.75,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:53.78,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Rods from God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:23.12,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,As expected of the world's \Nstrongest sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.18,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:30.71,Returner - Italics,ZOD/I,0,0,0,,How did Desir know about this devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:36.59,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Desir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:38.59,Returner - Italics,ROMANTICA/I,0,0,0,,The Tower Master has done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:41.47,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Dadeinuf is defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:45.22,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Your revolution ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:48.85,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,Revolution? Does that mean…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:53.08,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Twelve years ago, a civil war \Nbroke out in the Hebrion Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:58.69,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,One student stood up to free citizens \Nfrom the oppression of the nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:02.59,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,But the battle ended \Nwith the nobility's victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:06.59,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,and birth-based discrimination \Njust became worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:10.12,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Batour and the others were \Nangry with the nobles too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:14.25,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,You must be the remnants \Nof that revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:19.92,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,This world is absurd and unjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:25.09,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,It revolves around nobility, \Nand only nobility has power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:27.68,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,They force their \Nrotten ideology on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:31.69,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,It's not just the Hebrion Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:34.69,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,All over the world, foolish aristocrats
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:38.55,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,force their standards and \Nirrationality on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:47.38,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,This world is fundamentally wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:51.04,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,Even you couldn't deny that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:51.94,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:53.22,Returner - Default,RRAM,0,0,0,,Desir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.71,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,The discrimination \Nin the Academy still exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:05:59.59,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Simply for being born into\N certain families,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:02.33,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,talented people are robbed \Nof their future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:04.97,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,But take a good look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:10.72,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,The people you hurt are the very people \Nyou were supposed to protect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:15.23,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,Those who prefer the status quo and accept\Nthe situation as-is are equally to blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:20.48,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,I will destroy everything in this \Nworld to create true equality!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.93,0:06:22.28,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,This man…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:26.31,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,I'm going to restrain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:32.21,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,Did you say Dadeinuf was defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.62,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,How naive of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:36.63,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:39.76,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,It is calamity itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:43.13,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,Mere humans can't possibly defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.31,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:01.64,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.08,Returner - Default,AZEST,0,0,0,,Is this…?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.27,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.80,Returner - Default,CROW MASK,0,0,0,,You have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.55,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:35.90,Returner - Default,AZEST,0,0,0,,He gave us the slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.19,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Desir…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:41.08,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,Desir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:44.03,Returner - Italics,ROMANTICA/I,0,0,0,,Desir, I'm joining you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:47.32,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,I'm powerless by myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:51.33,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Desir? Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.97,Returner - Italics,ROMANTICA/I,0,0,0,,Desir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:55.21,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.96,Returner - Italics,ROMANTICA/I,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:58.58,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.97,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,We'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.70,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Please stay put where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:03.57,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:11.17,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,The future has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:15.49,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,We fought Dadeinuf in the Shadow World
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:17.45,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,much further in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:20.31,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,It's the Devil of Calamity \Nfrom the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:23.52,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Its power is catastrophe itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.93,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,We united our powers \Nand defeated the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:33.49,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,But the price we paid… \Nwas much too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.83,Returner - Default,AZEST,0,0,0,,Incredible mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:43.09,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,It's stronger than earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:45.46,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to defeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.02,0:08:49.83,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Romantica. Aaron. And Dadeinuf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:51.52,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:54.88,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Why did it show up in the real world \Nand not the Shadow World?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.40,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Is it because I traveled back in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:04.87,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Is something telling me\N I can't run from fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:07.44,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Desir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:14.16,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.16,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:20.71,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,We'll have to leave the Tower Master \Nto deal with Dadeinuf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.58,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,We'll only slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.95,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Let's help with the evacuation for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:26.95,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,We have to save \Nas many lives as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:27.60,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:28.58,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:29.67,Returner - Default,AZEST,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:46.84,Returner - Default,MAN A,0,0,0,,I'm saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:49.07,Returner - Default,MAN B,0,0,0,,But the city is in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:52.13,Returner - Default,CHILD,0,0,0,,Oh. Mommy, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.22,Returner - Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:55.41,Returner - Default,CHILD,0,0,0,,A huge firework!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.30,Returner - Default,AZEST,0,0,0,,Ice Crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:18.16,Returner - Default,AZEST,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:33.15,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Those two can handle \Nwhat's happening aboveground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:34.91,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,So focus, Romantica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:36.24,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:38.92,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,At two o'clock, 850 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.01,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:46.88,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Next, eleven o'clock, 1200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:00.61,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Doesn't quite reach, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:02.14,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,In that case…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:04.89,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Vortex!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.47,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:16.91,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Obsidian Saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.04,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.16,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,Heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:38.30,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Thank you. Please stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:40.95,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,What? Don't tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:43.31,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:03.98,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:08.31,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,I suppose it isn't called \N"devil" for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:16.99,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Romantica, the ships are \Nin a safe zone and out of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:18.43,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:20.43,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:24.97,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.97,0:12:27.51,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,I told you that pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:30.49,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's fine for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:36.32,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,We should evacuate too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:47.25,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Romantica.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.24,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.94,Returner - Default,PRAM,0,0,0,,Desir, we're at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.30,Returner - Default,AZEST,0,0,0,,Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:01.92,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:03.01,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Go ahead and get on the train—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:04.02,Returner - Italics,PRAM/I,0,0,0,,We'll wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:04.02,Returner - Italics - Top,AZEST/I,0,0,0,,We'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.08,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:11.94,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Romantica, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:15.09,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,I'm… fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:17.87,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,You don't look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:22.76,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,I used a little too much mana, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.23,0:13:31.29,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.39,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:35.07,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:36.42,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,The surviving Outers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:37.62,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:40.08,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,I can't overlook them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:41.75,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Romantica, you go to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.75,0:13:43.43,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,No! I'll come with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:45.30,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,You're out of mana, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:46.93,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,You can't go on anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:49.80,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,You're not wrong, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:54.44,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:56.32,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:14:01.52,Returner - Default,ROMANTICA,0,0,0,,Again, that smile of yours pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:11.54,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Romantica.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:22.82,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,I can't allow that ending \Nto happen again, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:30.60,Returner - Default,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,A… Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:32.82,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:35.31,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,I don't remember giving you my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:40.32,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Sir Aaron, Divide \NKingdom's captain of the knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:45.57,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,Oh! You're the sorcerer who helped \NHis Majesty evacuate from the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:49.96,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm Desir Herrman \Nfrom Hebrion Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.33,0:14:52.53,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,Allow me to thank you once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:55.34,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:56.35,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.23,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,I should be the one thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:06.13,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,I get to speak with you \Nagain, just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:13.44,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Divide Kingdom's ship \Nshould have departed already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:15.77,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:19.58,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,While this isn't my country, \NI couldn't sit idly by.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:22.47,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,So I'm looking for anyone \Nwho failed to get out in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.47,0:15:25.41,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,His Majesty yelled at me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.74,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,He hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:31.03,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Please leave here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:32.07,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:36.07,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,The might of that devil \Nwill reach here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:39.45,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,It hasn't unleashed \Nall of its power yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:42.05,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,Are you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.33,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:49.30,Returner - Default,AARON,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:51.21,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:52.25,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.47,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,Zod.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:37.10,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I will end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.65,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Absolute Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.71,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Magma Howl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:25.06,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,It's finally down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:27.16,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,Well done, Zod.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.28,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.95,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:36.39,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Dadeinuf hasn't revealed \Nits true form yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:46.59,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,That devil is said to have \Ndemolished a metropolis overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.05,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Its true identity…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:30.05,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,That's the true form of \NDadeinuf, the Devil of Calamity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.56,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,What on earth can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:40.32,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Desir, take care of Priscilla for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:43.94,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,To maintain the order of this \Nworld, we need the Saintess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.91,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,Zod, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.33,0:18:51.12,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,To maintain the order of this world, \Nwe cannot lose Zod Exarion, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:57.07,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Tower Master, please give \Nthe rest of your mana to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.21,0:19:02.54,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Are you saying you can \Ntake that thing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:03.30,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:12.61,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,Low-rank magic spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:15.04,Returner - Default,PRISCILLA,0,0,0,,What can you do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:15.93,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:20.43,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Magic has gradually changed \Nto meet the needs of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:23.02,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,But one thing that hasn't changed…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:28.56,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,is the fact that you must modify \Nthe mana in the air to use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:36.01,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Can you defeat that devil \Nby layering such simple spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:40.78,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,No, that devil can't be \Ndefeated with human power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:51.46,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:54.53,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,I need power stronger than that devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:13.94,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,Long forgotten from \Nthe memory of humankind,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:17.72,Returner - Default,DESIR,0,0,0,,it's the magic system of the tribe\Nwho were the originators of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:19.81,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:34.79,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Spells are nothing but a way \Nfor humans to convert mana into magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:42.61,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,That monster has mana itself in its \Nveins, so it doesn't need spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:47.67,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Simply uttering those words \Nwill call forth destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.12,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Isn't that right…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:53.17,Returner - Italics,DESIR/I,0,0,0,,Boromir Napolitan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:15.00,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:19.49,Returner - Default,ZOD,0,0,0,,Show me, Desir Herrman!
